{"actor":"","body":"[{\"ac\":1,\"text\":\"New Test performance_object_log_hybrid_distribution_pins asserts the seeded generator produces identical payload-size/key/retry/error sequences across two runs and non-uniform payload sizes: `cargo test -p pqueue-server --release --test performance_object_log_hybrid_tests performance_object_log_hybrid_distribution_pins -- --nocapture`.\",\"kind\":\"prose\",\"verifiable\":false},{\"ac\":2,\"text\":\"New Test performance_object_log_hybrid_cache_matrix_smoke runs warm and cold cache variants plus a \\u003e=2-way concurrency/batch sweep at resident\\u003c=1000 and emits one ledger cell per (cache,concurrency,batch): `cargo test -p pqueue-server --release --test performance_object_log_hybrid_tests performance_object_log_hybrid_cache_matrix_smoke -- --nocapture`.\",\"kind\":\"prose\",\"verifiable\":false},{\"ac\":3,\"text\":\"New Test performance_object_log_hybrid_scale_matrix parametrizes resident over {10k,100k,1M,10M}, skips-with-log any scale over the capacity guard, and runs \\u003e=5 reps per release cell recording median+CoV+outlier-trim fields: `cargo test -p pqueue-server --release --test performance_object_log_hybrid_tests performance_object_log_hybrid_scale_matrix -- --nocapture`.\",\"kind\":\"prose\",\"verifiable\":false},{\"ac\":4,\"text\":\"Existing Test performance_object_log_hybrid_smoke still passes: `PQUEUE_LEDGER_DIR=docs/perf/evidence cargo test -p pqueue-server --release --test performance_object_log_hybrid_tests performance_object_log_hybrid_smoke -- --nocapture`.\",\"kind\":\"mechanical\",\"verifiable\":true},{\"ac\":5,\"text\":\"`cargo fmt --check` passes.\",\"kind\":\"command\",\"verifiable\":true}]","created_at":"2026-07-01T19:55:47.812416877Z","kind":"ac-quality-low","source":"preclaim-ac-quality","summary":"score=0.40 threshold=0.50 verifiable=2/5"}
